<title>SLOVENIA: Slovenia June inflation eases to 8.8 pct yr/yr.</title>
<headline>Slovenia June inflation eases to 8.8 pct yr/yr.</headline>
<dateline>LJUBLJANA 1997-06-30</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Statistical Office of Slovenia reported the following economic indicator details on Monday.</p>
<p>RETAIL PRICE INFLATION</p>
<p>    (changes in percent)    June    May   June 96</p>
<p>    month-on-month change    0.4    1.3	0.5</p>
<p>    year-on-year change	8.8    8.9     10.5</p>
<p>-- Ljubljana newsroom, 386-61-125-8439</p>
</text>
